AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:mtg_transport") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "ISBN:0198506732") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "ISBN:0815340729") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0005244> "Enables the transmembrane transfer of an ion by a voltage-gated channel. An ion is an atom or group of atoms carrying an electric charge by virtue of having gained or lost one or more electrons. A voltage-gated channel is a channel whose open state is dependent on the voltage across the membrane in which it is embedded.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0005244> "voltage gated ion channel activity")
